  "type": "transform_in_place",
  "src": "monochrome one-cell-wide 4-connected closed orthogonal cycles on the background",
  "transform": "within each cycle, keep straight pixels in the original color; recolor bend pixels with the majority turn direction as yellow convex corners and bend pixels with the minority turn direction as red concave corners"
}
